    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueLeah",
      "key": "Rainy_Day_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I used to find rain depressing when I lived in the city. But here in Stardew Valley it's beautiful.",
      "translation": "Když jsem žila ve městě, déšť mi připadal skličující. Tady v údolí Stardew je ale nádherný.",
      "sourceSHA256": "ff3884d96012c2bb9f858858d717ec095f9538c563fc9f55dbdbf1c5bdd4137e",
      "translationSHA256": "b77ddb69a9a8f02e36f9c90dfd319be4b79da7c9a69a36bfeddebd0d7f9165ba",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueLeah",
      "key": "Rainy_Day_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Good morning! I got up early and did some mushroom hunting. Here, take one.[281 404 420 257]#$e#Searching for mushrooms is like going on a treasure hunt. It's a lot of fun.$h",
      "translation": "Dobré ráno! Vstala jsem brzy a vydala se hledat houby. Tady, jednu si vezmi.[281 404 420 257]#$e#Hledání hub je jako honba za pokladem. Je to veliká zábava.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "0b67c87841ab4a40975fc5477a3d6d2f76219bf2865c0d5ad6183bfa83da05ff",
      "translationSHA256": "b1bdf121bd1074911a2ba5b504d553f62a52a5ac672d556dfd68667c041b4e80",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueLeah",
      "key": "Rainy_Day_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It's days like this I'm really happy about my heavy-duty boots.$h",
      "translation": "Právě v takových dnech jsem opravdu ráda za své odolné boty.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "a0692e54df443d5d8763a69abda41854d3a4e59664ad42ca888b527ac766dc7a",
      "translationSHA256": "8c305a8d0c104ed8ed61a33af08d41699be0c96328b2b52b7c4f5e7d4e2f18b0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
